Task: Student Profile DOM Dashboard

Ek simple Student Profile webpage banao.

HTML mein ye hona chahiye:
Student Profile

Name: Muhammad Shayan
Course: Web Development
Status: Learning JavaScript

[ Change Name ]
[ Change Status ]
JavaScript requirements:

1. DOM Selection

getElementById() use karke:

Profile container
Name
Course
Status
Change Name button
Change Status button

select karo.

2. Change Name

Change Name button click karne par:

Muhammad Shayan

change hokar:

Shayan

ho jaye.

3. Change Status

Button click par:

Learning JavaScript

change hokar:

JavaScript Developer

ho jaye.

4. Paragraphs

Page mein minimum 3 <p> elements rakho.

getElementsByTagName("p") se unko select karo aur console mein show karo.

5. Parent/Child

Profile container ke parent/children identify karo.

Console mein container ke:

childNodes

show karo.

6. Siblings

Student khud identify kare:

Name
Course
Status

mein kaun siblings hain aur unka parent kaun hai.
